flowchart LR
    Sources[Public job sources] --> Collect[job_collector.py]
    Collect --> Policy[eligibility.py]
    Policy -->|India remote evidence| Rank[reflective_agent.py]
    Rank --> Memory[oracle_memory.py]
    Memory --> SQLite[(SQLite local mirror)]
    Memory --> RankerEval[adaptive_evaluation.py]
    Profile[candidate_profile.json] --> Memory
    Profile --> Rank
    FactReview[candidate_fact_review.json] --> FactGate[candidate_fact_review.py]
    Feedback[Explicit human feedback] --> Memory

    Scheduler[scheduler_24_7.py] --> Collect
    Scheduler --> RunLedger[agent_run_ledger.py]
    RunLedger --> SQLite
    Scheduler --> PrepGate[application_preparation.py]
    PrepGate -->|Only with --prepare-approved-materials| Prep[auto_applicator.py]
    FactGate --> PrepGate
    FactGate --> Prep
    Prep --> Vault[resume_vault.py]
    Vault --> SQLite

    Browser[Local browser] --> API[Starlette app_server.py]
    API --> SQLite
    API --> RankerEval
    API --> Vault
    API --> UI[dashboard_ui.html]
    API --> RunLedger

    Review[Person reviews candidate facts and role] --> Draft[Role application draft]
    Draft --> Manual[Person reviews and submits on employer site]
    Manual --> Receipt[Receipt and acknowledgement evidence]
    Receipt --> API

    subgraph Runtime notes
        PolicyNote[Phrase rules reject detected India exclusions and clear hybrid or onsite requirements]
        RankNote[Ranking is deterministic; scores are evidence-overlap heuristics]
        StoreNote[Workflow CRUD uses SQLite even when an Oracle connection opens]
        UploadNote[Standalone browser helpers can upload resumes; they are not called by discovery]
    end

    Policy -.-> PolicyNote
    Rank -.-> RankNote
    SQLite -.-> StoreNote
    Vault -.-> UploadNote
